<title>HUNGARY: GRABOPLAST H1 AFTER-TAX PROFIT 1.097 BLN.</title>
<headline>GRABOPLAST H1 AFTER-TAX PROFIT 1.097 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six-month period ending June 30.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>					   Jan-June 1997    Jan-June 1996</p>
<p>    Group operating profit	   1,061.8  vs     719.9</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit	     1,332.5  vs     516.5</p>
<p>    Group after-tax profit	   1,097.0  vs     423.1</p>
<p>    Group net sales		    8,286.3  vs   6,894.0</p>
<p>Group net financial income 213.1 profit vs 222.2 loss</p>
<p>    Group net extraord. income     57.5 profit vs  18.8 profit</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (Forint)   259    vs     129</p>
<p>NOTE - Graboplast Rt is a home improvement products manufacturer. The figures are consolidated and were calculated in accordance with Hungarian Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
